    narr:narration """This hub tracks the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the point of consensus. As of August 2026, the narrative has shifted from abstract strategy to concrete implementation. The team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_1), marking the functional realization of the capture thesis. This milestone is accompanied by [record-high velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_2), which the team attributes to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_3), framing it as the technical catalyst for recent performance gains.""" ;
